From 9f51fde1875f4c6f0b7d7457f7d4602c41f7d625 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 16:00:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SpotPass Tasks: game names from a built-in title list (Build
 152)

Titles not in the game list showed as title IDs (7 Nov 15:58: Skater Cat,
Samurai Warriors Chronicles 3, SmileBASIC, Swapdoodle, Miitopia ...). New
resource dist/title_names/title_names.tsv (7534 titles: title ID, tab, name),
made from the SpotPass server package's titledb.json (3dsdb, Europe names
first, as its admin panel does), title_dumps.json and spotpass_apps.json, plus
the HOME Menu, Nintendo eShop (EUR, its BGM tasks), the HOME Menu theme shop
(thmtop/thmnews) and the SpotPass module (NetPass sprelay). The window looks
there when the game list doesn't have the title; other system titles keep
their kind and ID.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
